to appoint him as the Crown Prince sooner.

297
00:11:52,039 --> 00:11:53,440
Does he think I know nothing?

298
00:11:54,679 --> 00:11:55,360
Now,

299
00:11:55,399 --> 00:11:56,879
Shen Yi is not in his right mind,

300
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,399
and the source of that secret letter has not been clarified.

301
00:11:59,559 --> 00:12:01,240
He is eager to have me deal with Shen Yi

302
00:12:01,279 --> 00:12:02,200
and Shen residence.

303
00:12:02,679 --> 00:12:04,360
His ambition is exposed.

304
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:05,879
Who else

305
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,320
would have the audacity

306
00:12:07,559 --> 00:12:08,840
to plot against the Prime Minister?

307
00:12:11,159 --> 00:12:12,039
Actually,

308
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:13,519
there's no need to rush to judgment.

309
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:15,559
We can call the Second Prince here

310
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:16,480
to clarify the matter.

311
00:12:17,039 --> 00:12:17,799
Perhaps

312
00:12:17,919 --> 00:12:18,919
there's another reason.

313
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:20,600
Go.

314
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,240
Yes.

315
00:12:21,279 --> 00:12:22,279
Bring this unfilial son here.

316
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:23,360
I want to interrogate him myself.

317
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,360
Yes, Your Majesty.

318
00:12:27,639 --> 00:12:29,480
I didn't expect that in just a few days,

319
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:31,879
Prince Yu has cleared the Prime Minister's name.

320
00:12:32,279 --> 00:12:33,919
I entrusted this matter to you,

321
00:12:33,919 --> 00:12:34,720
and it was indeed a wise decision.

322
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,799
I'm flattered, Your Majesty.

323
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:40,759
To determine if Minister Shen is unrelated to this case,

324
00:12:41,039 --> 00:12:42,679
we need to wait until his condition improves.

325
00:12:42,879 --> 00:12:43,759
Then we'll know.

326
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,240
I humbly request

327
00:12:45,559 --> 00:12:47,000
that you allow Minister Shen

328
00:12:47,159 --> 00:12:48,000
to be released from prison for medical treatment.

329
00:12:48,759 --> 00:12:50,440
Because the conditions in prison are really harsh,

330
00:12:50,679 --> 00:12:51,440
which is not conducive to treatment.

331
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:54,480
It would be better to let him move into my residence.

332
00:12:54,759 --> 00:12:56,120
First, it's convenient for treatment.

333
00:12:56,679 --> 00:12:58,720
Second, after all, he is a criminal,

334
00:12:58,919 --> 00:13:00,159
and still needs to be strictly guarded.

335
00:13:01,399 --> 00:13:01,919
Granted.

336
00:13:02,879 --> 00:13:04,159
Send my imperial physician to you.

337
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:06,200
Make sure to cure Prime Minister Shen.

338
00:13:06,919 --> 00:13:07,360
Yes.

339
00:13:11,519 --> 00:13:13,360
What else do you request?

340
00:13:13,399 --> 00:13:14,240
Just say it.

341
00:13:15,919 --> 00:13:16,360
Your Majesty,

342
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:17,919
I

343
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,559
do have one more request.

344
00:13:20,559 --> 00:13:21,399
This case

345
00:13:21,519 --> 00:13:22,799
can be solved

346
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:24,200
was all thanks to the assistance

347
00:13:24,519 --> 00:13:25,399
of Prime Minister Shen's daughter,

348
00:13:25,519 --> 00:13:26,320
Shen Suhe.

349
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,600
She was expelled to Lingguo Temple

350
00:13:29,759 --> 00:13:30,480
for reflection.

351
00:13:30,919 --> 00:13:31,360
However,

352
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:33,679
she left the temple without permission,

353
00:13:34,799 --> 00:13:35,840
I humbly request that Your Majesty,

354
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:38,440
considering her contribution to the case,

355
00:13:39,039 --> 00:13:40,080
could exempt her from punishment,

356
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:41,480
and allow her to enter the mansion

357
00:13:41,759 --> 00:13:42,600
to take care of Minister Shen.

358
00:13:55,639 --> 00:13:57,320
Shen Suhe.

359
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:00,879
His Majesty's oral edict.

360
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:04,320
Prince Rui, please see His Majesty immediately.

361
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:05,759
Your Highness.

362
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:10,759
Your Highness.

363
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:11,519
It's okay.

364
00:14:15,559 --> 00:14:16,120
Chief Eunuch Li.

365
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:17,879
I wonder why my father suddenly called me.

366
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:19,200
Is there anything urgent?

367
00:14:19,799 --> 00:14:20,960
Your Highness,

368
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:23,000
it's all by His Majesty's order.

369
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:25,480
I'm just following orders.

370
00:14:25,799 --> 00:14:27,360
If you have any questions,

371
00:14:27,639 --> 00:14:29,200
you'd better ask him

372
00:14:29,639 --> 00:14:30,799
in person.

373
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:38,919
Chief Li, aren't you supposed to take me

374
00:14:38,919 --> 00:14:40,000
to the palace to see my father?

375
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:41,279
What does this mean?

376
00:14:42,799 --> 00:14:44,120
Your Highness, you may not know.

377
00:14:44,559 --> 00:14:45,200
This time,

378
00:14:45,399 --> 00:14:46,759
it's true that His Majesty summoned you,

379
00:14:47,039 --> 00:14:48,200
but not to the palace,

380
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:48,919
but to

381
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,879
the Dali Court.

382
00:14:52,039 --> 00:14:52,679
Your Highness,

383
00:14:53,399 --> 00:14:54,080
please.

384
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:56,960
Your Highness.

385
00:14:58,279 --> 00:14:58,759
Chuchu,

386
00:14:59,000 --> 00:14:59,720
go to the palace now

387
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:00,960
and beg my mother to save me.

388
00:15:01,679 --> 00:15:02,200
Okay.
